#: ../api/_autosummary/pyvista_js.Light.rst:2
msgid "pyvista\\_js.Light"
msgstr "pyvista\\_js.Light"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:1
msgid "Light class."
msgstr "Light クラス。"

#: ../api/_autosummary/pyvista_js.Light.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:3
msgid ""
"The position of the light. The interpretation of the position depends on the"
" type of the light and whether the light has a transformation matrix."
msgstr "ライトの位置。位置の解釈は、ライトのタイプとライトが変換行列を持つかどうかに依存します。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:7
msgid ""
"The focal point of the light. The interpretation of the focal point depends "
"on the type of the light and whether the light has a transformation matrix."
msgstr "ライトの注視点。注視点の解釈は、ライトのタイプとライトが変換行列を持つかどうかに依存します。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:11
msgid ""
"The color of the light. The ambient, diffuse and specular colors will all be"
" set to this color on creation."
msgstr "ライトの色。作成時にアンビエント、ディフューズ、スペキュラの各色がすべてこの色に設定されます。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:14
msgid ""
"The type of the light. One of ``'Headlight'``, ``'CameraLight'`` or "
"``'SceneLight'``.      - A headlight is attached to the camera, looking at "
"its       focal point along the axis of the camera.      - A camera light "
"also moves with the camera, but it can       occupy a general position with "
"respect to it.      - A scene light is stationary with respect to the scene,"
"       as it does not follow the camera. This is the default."
msgstr ""
"ライトのタイプ。``'Headlight'``、``'CameraLight'``、``'SceneLight'`` のいずれかです。      - "
"ヘッドライトはカメラに取り付けられ、カメラの軸に沿って注視点を見ます。      - "
"カメラライトもカメラと共に移動しますが、カメラに対して一般の位置を取れます。      - "
"シーンライトはシーンに対して固定で、カメラに追従しません。これがデフォルトです。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:14
msgid ""
"The type of the light. One of ``'Headlight'``, ``'CameraLight'`` or "
"``'SceneLight'``."
msgstr "ライトのタイプ。``'Headlight'``、``'CameraLight'`` または ``'SceneLight'`` のいずれか。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:17
msgid ""
"A headlight is attached to the camera, looking at its focal point along the "
"axis of the camera."
msgstr "ヘッドライトはカメラに取り付けられ、カメラの軸に沿って注視点を見ます。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:20
msgid ""
"A camera light also moves with the camera, but it can occupy a general "
"position with respect to it."
msgstr "カメラライトもカメラと共に移動しますが、カメラに対して一般の位置を取れます。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:23
msgid ""
"A scene light is stationary with respect to the scene, as it does not follow"
" the camera. This is the default."
msgstr "シーンライトはシーンに対して固定で、カメラに追従しません。これがデフォルトです。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:26
msgid "The brightness of the light (between 0 and 1)."
msgstr "ライトの明るさ (0 から 1 の間)。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:28
msgid ""
"Set if the light is positional.  The default is a directional light, i.e. an"
" infinitely distant point source. A positional light with a cone angle of at"
" least 90 degrees acts like a spherical point source. A positional light "
"with a cone angle that is less than 90 degrees is known as a spotlight."
msgstr ""
"ライトが位置型かどうかを設定します。デフォルトはディレクショナルライト、つまり無限遠の点光源です。円錐角が 90 "
"度以上の位置型ライトは球状の点光源のように振る舞います。円錐角が 90 度未満の位置型ライトはスポットライトと呼ばれます。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:28
msgid "Set if the light is positional."
msgstr "ライトが位置型かどうかを設定します。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:30
msgid ""
"The default is a directional light, i.e. an infinitely distant point source."
" A positional light with a cone angle of at least 90 degrees acts like a "
"spherical point source. A positional light with a cone angle that is less "
"than 90 degrees is known as a spotlight."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトはディレクショナルライト、つまり無限遠の点光源です。円錐角が 90 度以上の位置型ライトは球状の点光源のように振る舞います。円錐角が 90 "
"度未満の位置型ライトはスポットライトと呼ばれます。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:36
msgid "Cone angle of a positional light in degrees."
msgstr "位置型ライトの円錐角 (度)。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:38
msgid "The exponent of the cosine used for spotlights."
msgstr "スポットライトに使用されるコサインの指数。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:40
msgid ""
"Quadratic attenuation constants.  The values are a 3-length sequence which "
"specifies the constant, linear and quadratic constants in this order. These "
"parameters only have an effect for positional lights."
msgstr ""
"二次減衰定数。値は 3 要素の系列で、この順に定数項、一次項、二次項の定数を指定します。これらのパラメータは位置型ライトにのみ効果があります。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:40
msgid "Quadratic attenuation constants."
msgstr "二次減衰定数。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:42
msgid ""
"The values are a 3-length sequence which specifies the constant, linear and "
"quadratic constants in this order. These parameters only have an effect for "
"positional lights."
msgstr "値は 3 要素の系列で、この順に定数項、一次項、二次項の定数を指定します。これらのパラメータは位置型ライトにのみ効果があります。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:48
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "例"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:52
msgid ""
"Headlight. For headlights the position and focal point properties are "
"meaningless. No matter where you move the camera, the light always emanates "
"from the view point:"
msgstr "ヘッドライト。ヘッドライトでは位置と注視点のプロパティは意味を持ちません。カメラをどの場所に動かしても、ライトは常に視点から発せられます:"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:68
msgid ""
"Camera light. Camera lights move together with the camera, but can occupy "
"any fixed relative position with respect to the camera:"
msgstr "カメラライト。カメラライトはカメラと共に移動しますが、カメラに対して任意の固定された相対位置を取れます:"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/light.pydocstring of pyvista_js.light.Light:78
msgid ""
"Scene light. Scene lights are attached to the scene, their position and "
"focal point are interpreted as global coordinates:"
msgstr "シーンライト。シーンライトはシーンに取り付けられ、位置と注視点はグローバル座標として解釈されます:"

